{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_WdgM_00223","versions":[{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_WdgM_00223","release":"R19-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_WdgM_00223","release":"R20-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_WdgM_00223","release":"R21-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_WdgM_00223","release":"R22-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_WdgM_00223","release":"R23-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_WdgM_00223","release":"R24-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_WdgM_00223@rel:R25-11#f1578297","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_WdgM_00223","release":"R25-11","content":"[SWS_WdgM_00223]\nUpstream requirements: SRS_ModeMgm_09143,\nSRS_ModeMgm_09161,\nSRS_ModeMgm_-\n09226, SRS_ModeMgm_09231\n⌈The Watchdog Manager module shall update the trigger condition every time the\nGlobal Supervision Status has been recomputed. The following rules shall be used\nto derive the decision, how to set the triggering condition:\n1. For the states WDGM_GLOBAL_STATUS_OK, WDGM_GLOBAL_STATUS_FAILED\nand WDGM_GLOBAL_STATUS_EXPIRED, the function WdgM_MainFunction\nshall correctly set the trigger conditions.\n2. For the state WDGM_GLOBAL_STATUS_STOPPED, the function WdgM_MainFunc-\ntion shall set the trigger condition to 0, which results in a reset through HW\nwatchdog(s).\n3. For the state WDGM_GLOBAL_STATUS_DEACTIVATED, the function WdgM_Main-\nFunction shall not perform setting of the trigger condition (because this state\nmeans that the Watchdog Manager module is not properly initialized).\n⌋","meta":{"source_pdf":"SWS_WatchdogManager.pdf","source_page":55,"trigger_kind":"snippet_ingest"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00","text_key":"e7a1c2d829bc"}],"lifecycle":{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_WdgM_00223","is_dropped":false,"first_active_release":"R19-11","last_active_release":"R25-11","dropped_in":[],"first_dropped_release":null,"absent_before":[],"platform_releases":["R18-10","R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"latest_platform_release":"R25-11","text_releases":["R25-11"],"presence_only":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11"],"unchecked":["R18-10"]},"element":{"kind":"requirement","name":"","module":"WdgM","cluster":"system","page":"","doc_type":"SWS","ai":false,"first":"R19-11","last":"R25-11","changed":[],"distinct":1,"universe":"CP"},"evidence":{"figures":[],"snippets":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_WDGM_SECTION_7_4_2_Setting_the_Trigger_Conditions","doc":"SWS_WatchdogManager","p":55,"rel":["R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_WdgM_00223] im Text von SWS_WatchdogManager.","n":4,"x":"7.4.2 Setting the Trigger Conditions The Watchdog Manager module uses the service WdgIf_SetTriggerCondition of the Watchdog Interface modules to set (update) the trigger condition of the watch- dogs.…","src":"manifest"}],"cited_in":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_SAFETYCONCEPTSTATUSREPORT_SECTION_01_AUTOSAR_SWS_Wat","kind":"snip","doc":"SafetyConceptStatusReport","p":15,"t":"01 AUTOSAR_SWS_Wat chdogManager SWS_WdgM_00119, SWS_WdgM_00120, SWS_WdgM_00121, SWS_WdgM_00122, SWS_WdgM_00223, SWS_WdgM_00197, SWS_WdgM_00…"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_SAFETYCONCEPTSTATUSREPORT_SECTION_5_3_2_SRS_ModeManagement","kind":"snip","doc":"SafetyConceptStatusReport","p":47,"t":"5.3.2 SRS ModeManagement Safety requirement Satisfied by Related SWS SRS_ModeMgm_09220 Configuration of all transition rel